  m_Text: 'THE MANNINGCAST IS ABOUT TO START!


    CROSS 7 MOVING STUDIO LANES AND
    REACH THE COUCH.


    ATHLETES AND CHALLENGE FLAGS COST A LIFE. SANDWICHES COST
    TIME.


    RECLINERS, REMOTES, AND BLUE QUARTER-ZIPS ARE SAFE.


    COLLECT
    A FOOTBALL, THEN PRESS SPACE TO DISTRACT THE NEAREST ATHLETE.'
